        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The Louisiana Architect — Five-State AIA Conference Set</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fdfcf5;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 60px 40px 20px 60px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 430px;\n    flex: 0 0 430px;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-left: 55px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Ads ---------- */\n  .ad {\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .sans {\n    font-family: \"Futura\", \"Century Gothic\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  /* Ad 1 */\n  .ad1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 40px 20px 30px 20px;\n  }\n  .ad1 .name {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    letter-spacing: .5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .ad1 .brands {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-top: 42px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n  }\n  .ad1 .contact {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: .8px;\n    margin-top: 46px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n\n  /* Ad 2 */\n  .ad2 {\n    padding: 22px 18px 22px 18px;\n  }\n  .ad2 .script {\n    font-family: \"Brush Script MT\", \"Segoe Script\", cursive;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .ad2 .addr {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n  }\n  .ad2 .tag {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: .4px;\n    margin: 14px 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  .ad2 .body {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .ad2 .booth {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n  }\n\n  /* Ad 3 */\n  .ad3 {\n    padding: 26px 18px 24px 18px;\n  }\n  .ad3 .title {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 37px;\n    letter-spacing: -.5px;\n  }\n  .ad3 .rule {\n    width: 175px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #000;\n    margin: 14px 0 18px 8px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n  .ad3 .feat {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .ad3 .brick {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .ad3 .and {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    margin: 16px 0;\n  }\n  .ad3 .tile {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n  .ad3 .foot {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 23px;\n    margin-top: 34px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Article ---------- */\n  h1.head {\n    font-family: \"Futura\", \"Century Gothic\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: 33px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .article p {\n    font-size: 18.5px;\n    line-height: 1.42;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n    text-indent: 26px;\n  }\n  .article p.spaced {\n    margin-top: 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Rendering ad ---------- */\n  .render-ad {\n    border: 2px solid #000;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    padding: 14px 22px 18px 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Futura\", \"Century Gothic\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .render-ad .complete {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .render-ad .big {\n    font-family: \"Arial Black\", \"Haettenschweiler\", Impact, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 158px;\n    line-height: .92;\n    letter-spacing: -4px;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n    transform: scaleY(1.12);\n    transform-origin: center top;\n  }\n  .render-ad .sub {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .render-ad .blurb {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 18px 40px 0 40px;\n  }\n  .render-ad .booth {\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n  .render-ad .credits {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .credits .c1 {\n    width: 40%;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .credits .c1 .row1 span {\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin: 0 10px;\n  }\n  .credits .c1 .row2 {\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: .5px;\n  }\n  .credits .c2 {\n    width: 32%;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .credits .c2 .plain {\n    font-style: normal;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n  }\n  .credits .c3 {\n    width: 28%;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .credits .c3 .it { font-style: italic; }\n\n  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    position: relative;\n    height: 26px;\n  }\n  .footer .pg {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 6px;\n    font-family: \"Futura\", \"Century Gothic\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .footer .mag {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-family: \"Futura\", \"Century Gothic\", \"Trebuchet MS\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n\n      <!-- Ad 1 -->\n      <div class=\"ad ad1 sans\">\n        <div class=\"name\">MONCERET &amp; BRISTER<br>APPLIANCES, INC.</div>\n        <div class=\"brands\">RCA VICTOR<br>RCA WHIRLPOOL</div>\n        <div class=\"contact\">\n          416 Lofaso &nbsp;—&nbsp; DI 8-6702 &nbsp;—&nbsp; Baton Rouge<br>\n          We invite you to visit Exhibit No. 26\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Ad 2 -->\n      <div class=\"ad ad2 sans\">\n        <div class=\"script\">Architectural Products<br>Manufacturing Company, Inc.</div>\n        <div class=\"addr\"><span>1245 Texas Avenue</span><span>Shreveport, Louisiana</span></div>\n        <div class=\"tag\">PRESENTS TOMORROWS PRODUCTS TODAY</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">\n          Permanently Finished Color Coordinated Building Components Including Completely Factory Fabricated PERMA FINISH<sup>®</sup> Doors, Toilet Partitions, and Cabinetry.\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"booth\">See our Display in Booth 30 and Wall Space 58</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Ad 3 -->\n      <div class=\"ad ad3\">\n        <div class=\"title\">Cocreham Materials Corp.</div>\n        <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n        <div class=\"feat\">Featuring</div>\n        <div class=\"brick\">All Types of Face Brick</div>\n        <div class=\"and\">And</div>\n        <div class=\"tile\">ARKETEX GLAZED TILE</div>\n        <div class=\"foot\"><span>Box 442</span><span>Baton Rouge, La.</span></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <h1 class=\"head\">FIVE-STATE AIA<br>CONFERENCE SET</h1>\n      <div class=\"article\">\n        <p>Architects from the five states of Louisiana, Mississippi, Arkansas, Alabama, and Tennessee meet in Baton Rouge on November 15-18 to look at the performance of their profession in regional growth and to map out their role for the future in development of the Gulf South States.</p>\n        <p>Basic factors affecting development of the five states will be examined by panelists well qualified in their respective fields of politics, economics, technical factors, sociological influences, etc. The participants will attempt to chart the means by which architects can influence development with an appreciation for function, durability and beauty.</p>\n        <p>Panelists and speakers will include Phil Will, Jr. and Henry Wright, president and first vice-president of the American Institute of Architects, respectively; Clinton Brush III, Gulf States Regional Director; Dexter Keezer, chief economist for McGraw-Hill Publishing Company; Dudley Hunt, senior editor of Architectural Record; Buford Pickens, director of Building at Washington University in St. Louis and former dean of the Tulane School of Architecture; Edward Steimel, executive director of Louisiana's Public Affairs Research Council; James Shilstone, partner in Shilstone Testing Laboratories.</p>\n        <p class=\"spaced\">Thomas Biggs, member of the National AIA Education Committee; O. J. Baker, head of the LSU Dept. of Architecture; John Williams, head of the Dept. of Architecture at the University of Arkansas; Gordon C. Wittenberg, national chairman of the AIA Public Relations Committee; George F. Pierce, chairman of the National AIA's Chapter Affairs Committee; Wolf Von Eckardt, and Maurice Perreault, both of the National AIA Staff, and Max Fetty, partner in Fetty/Hundemer &amp; Associates, Baton Rouge public relations firm.</p>\n        <p class=\"spaced\">Some 60 exhibit spaces have been rented by manufacturers wherein they will exhibit building products to attending architects.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Rendering ad -->\n  <div class=\"render-ad\">\n    <div class=\"complete\">A COMPLETE</div>\n    <div class=\"big\">RENDERING</div>\n    <div class=\"sub\">AND GRAPHIC ARTS SERVICE</div>\n    <div class=\"blurb\">\n      For the finest in Architectural Renderings, prepared skillfully and with professional quality in every detail, you are invited to make our studios your standard source. At your disposal is our full-time staff of six capable, experienced artists — the most versatile such a group now serving clients throughout the Southeastern states. You are cordially invited to visit our studios and inspect our work and facilities.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"booth\">See our wall display located at Booth Number 60 at the convention.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"credits\">\n      <div class=\"c1\">\n        <div class=\"row1\"><span>Advertising</span> &nbsp;•&nbsp; <span>Marketing</span> &nbsp;•&nbsp; <span>Merchandising</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row2\">FETTY/HUNDEMER &amp; ASSOCIATES</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c2\">\n        Baton Rouge, Louisiana<br>\n        <span class=\"plain\">SUITE 400, UNION FEDERAL BUILDING</span><br>\n        500 Laurel Street\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c3\">\n        DIckens 2-2681<br>\n        JOHN H. SCHAEFFER<br>\n        <span class=\"it\">Executive Art Director</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"pg\">6</div>\n    <div class=\"mag\">THE LOUISIANA ARCHITECT</div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
